# A new game from the first frame to free control on the island's pier (3.0.2, English). Recorded live on the Mac
# (live.py's sent.txt) and replayed with `live.py <root> play tools/play/scenarios/intro_to_island.live`, starting
# right after run.sh (frame 0-ish). Blocks are sent when the game reaches that frame; the island and the residents
# are rolled anew on every new game, so the plaza and the tent spot are played live after this.
# Character: "ana", birthday 1/1, default look, default answers (hemisphere, island map: the first one).
# frame 1260
press A 6 25
# frame 1710
press A 10 30
# frame 2415
# (A also types on the name keyboard when it comes up: "11111", deleted next)
press A 15 40
# frame 3390
# name: delete, then a-n-a on the keyboard with the d-pad
press B 5 12
press Down 2 12
press A 1 15
press Down 1 12
press Right 5 12
press A 1 15
press Up 1 12
press Left 5 12
press A 1 15
# frame 3900
# Plus confirms the name, then the birthday screen
press Plus 1 60
press A 4 40
# frame 4380
press Plus 1 60
press A 8 40
# frame 5025
press A 10 40
# frame 5640
# Plus confirms the character creator
press Plus 1 60
press A 8 40
# frame 6300
press A 15 40
# frame 7125
press A 15 40
# frame 7995
press A 25 30
# frame 9000
# the last questions, then the opening movie (65 s) and the flight
press A 40 30
# frame 13200
# arrival: Timmy on the pier
press A 30 30
# frame 14385
walk up 60
press A 10 30
